Answer: We have
 \begin{align}
\mathbb E[X] &= \sum_{n=0}^2 \mathbb E[X\mid Y=n]\mathbb P(Y=n)\\
&=\mathbb E[X\mid Y=0]\cdot\frac15 + \mathbb E[X\mid Y=1]\cdot\frac25 + \mathbb E[X\mid Y=4]\cdot\frac25\\
&=0+0+0=0.
\end{align} 
